# Run and comparison output is NEVER committed.  See
# docs/design/error-suite-design.md §2 ("Distribution: the suite is public, the
# results are not") -- several tool EULAs prohibit publishing benchmark
# results, and a committed run file is one `git push` away from being one.
# tests/test_structure.py::test_no_run_file_is_tracked_by_git enforces this
# mechanically.
runs/
compare.*
.rubric-cache.json
.scratch/
